WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.320
- All right, let's finish things up

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.510
with something cute that
hit my social media feed.

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:04.795
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.795 --> 00:00:07.440
(rock music)

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.930
Every mama knows there are
mornings your kids wake up

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.090
and complain they don't
want to go to school.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.160
Well, not two-year-old, Palmer.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.630
Her grandpa takes her to school

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.699
and each morning she responds like this.

00:00:18.699 --> 00:00:19.532
- Ippy!

00:00:22.571 --> 00:00:25.000
(little girl exclaims)

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.583
(upbeat music)

00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:35.820
Oh my gosh, it's precious.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.840
I love it.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.720
We have Palmer on the line
along with her mom, Hannah,

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.180
and her Grandpa Skip, who she calls Ippy.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.950
What's going on, y'all?

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.758
- Hi, Kelly.
- Hey, Kelly.

00:00:45.758 --> 00:00:46.950
Thanks for having us.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:47.783
- Absolutely.

00:00:47.783 --> 00:00:48.960
I love your family.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.210
So Skip, how did this all get started?

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:55.830
- Well, it started, Hannah had
her second child in December

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:59.490
and I'd always taken my kids to school

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:00.900
until they could drive,

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.700
and when she had her second child

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:03.750
it was a little overwhelming.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.280
And it was like around Christmas time.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.467
And so when school started
up in January, I said,

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:09.960
"I'm gonna pick up where I left off"

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.840
and started taking Palmer to school.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:15.090
- Oh, it's so, she's so excited.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.460
Oh, it's the greatest video footage.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.450
I know, she almost busted there

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.220
and you're like, "Don't do it!"

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.170
Hannah and Palmer, what does it mean

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.910
to have Ippy drive Palmer to school?

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:24.840
That's really cool.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.790
And it's a cool family tradition at that.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:27.810
- Yes, it is.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.360
Well, I feel like I'm just very lucky

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:33.060
to have had such a
hands-on dad growing up.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:36.420
I mean, he even coached my
volleyball team in middle school,

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.340
which he knew absolutely nothing about

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.080
just to spend time with me.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:43.920
And so, it's really special
to see him treat her

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.540
with the same importance

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.030
and honestly, more importance than me.

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:51.690
But I get my mornings quiet

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.090
and he gets a special time with her.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.910
And he even made it a
point to dress up for her

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:00.000
on Valentine's Day, tuxedo and all,

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.255
his flowers and her teachers
just oohed and awed over him.

00:02:04.255 --> 00:02:08.250
So he is quite the hit in this household.

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.360
- Aw, that's amazing.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:10.470
It's amazing to have that,

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.660
and I'm so happy that you
had that daddy as well,

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.849
and that you now get to be
Grandpa, or Ippy rather.

00:02:15.849 --> 00:02:17.700
Thank y'all so much for sharing this.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.380
Do you wanna say something, Skip?

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.090
- Well, I was just gonna
say what an honor it is

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:24.060
to be on your show and to be Ippy.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:26.130
- Aw, I love you.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:28.200
Oh, I love your family, guys.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.580
Thank you so much, Palmer.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.480
Thank you, Hannah.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.313
Thank you, Skip.

00:02:31.313 --> 00:02:33.348
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:33.348 --> 00:02:35.459
(crowd cheering)

00:02:35.459 --> 00:02:36.540
- Thank you, Kelly.
- Thank you.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:37.373
- Absolutely.

00:02:37.373 --> 00:02:38.206
That's not all though.

00:02:38.206 --> 00:02:39.570
Our season long partner Pilot Pen

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.220
makers of FriXion, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.480
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.450
want to celebrate those creating
fearlessly just like y'all.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.410
And I just love your family

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.940
so they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:48.773
How's that sound?

00:02:48.773 --> 00:02:50.364
(crowd cheering)

00:02:50.364 --> 00:02:52.245
- Oh my goodness, thank you.

00:02:52.245 --> 00:02:53.126
Did you hear that?

00:02:53.126 --> 00:02:54.805
- [Skip] Look at you, started
Palmer's college fund.

00:02:54.805 --> 00:02:56.427
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:56.427 --> 00:02:57.427
Bye, Palmer!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.810
Thank you to all of our guests this hour,

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.430
Helen Hunt, Jodie Turner-Smith,

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:06.227
the cast of "Black Adam",
Leanna, Melinda, Shelly Muniz,

00:03:06.227 --> 00:03:10.080
Roxanne Vargas, and all our
friends at NBC 6 South Florida.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:10.913
Y'all have a great day

00:03:10.913 --> 00:03:12.763
and if it's not, try and change it.

